homelab-dns (0.1.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Pull model: homelab-dns-pull-allow-from + homelab-dns-pull.timer keep
    webserver-allow-from in sync with the live DKIM-signer set from
    homelab-api (new homelab-dns/api_base debconf), so a signer is allowed
    automatically -- no per-signer allowlist edit. Reconfigures only on
    change.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 09:53:36 -0500

